st landscape, all at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ginormous open world, <strong>filled with secrets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-night cycle with <strong>gorgeous sunsets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand crafted paradise, for <strong>you to explore.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "EVAC is the Worlds Greatest Helicopter Game. Fly explosive combat missions, high-speed races, rescue missions, and a variety of utility operations.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490700/22035d03ecf7f85fa88ed9f147fcb7a7081373e3/header.jpg?t=1784684704", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490700/4762ece488c0727fa30bfe6669b494b49367a8b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784684704", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490700/4762ece488c0727fa30bfe6669b494b49367a8b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784684704", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-Core 64-bit Intel or AMD processor, 2.0 GHZ CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB DirectX 11 compatible video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["JADC Games"], "publishers": ["JADC Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 3938500, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id